    "type": "mcq",
    "stem": "Displacement under constant acceleration is given by $s=ut+\\tfrac{1}{2}at^2$. For $u=3\\,\\text{m/s}$, $a=2\\,\\text{m/s}^2$, $t=4\\,\\text{s}$, find $s$.",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "$20\\,\\text{m}$",
        "is_correct": false,
        "explanation": "Missed acceleration term."
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "$28\\,\\text{m}$",
        "is_correct": true,
        "explanation": "s=12+16=28 m."
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "$44\\,\\text{m}$",
        "is_correct": false,
        "explanation": "Wrong arithmetic."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "$60\\,\\text{m}$",
        "is_correct": false,
        "explanation": "Overcounted terms."
      }
